# Movement

Player locomotion follows [`docs/game-design.md`](docs/game-design.md) (Movement). Do not ship walk-and-jump as the destination controller.

- Kit: walk/run/sprint, jump, mantle, **wall climb**, **wall run**, ledge hang.
- Surfaces default to climbable. Yellow-ledge-only is wrong.
- Traversal meter is generous (sprint/climb/wall-run). Empty = slide/drop, not death.
- Same kit in hub and worlds, on a controller. Combat stays heavy; parkour is not removed in fights.
- Creator body scale changes capsule/anims, not the move list.
- Not in the first slice: glider, grapple, swim.
